Revision history for Markdown-Pod-Embed

1.011  2026-09-26

    - First release under the Markdown::Pod::Embed namespace.
    - Add recursive discovery, dry-run processing and atomic updates.
    - Prefer Markdown sidecars while retaining embedded Markdown support.
    - Preserve POD around quoted, indented and marker-like Markdown edge cases.
    - Rewrite verified companion sidecar module links for generated POD.
